  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> 刀具质量的精髓 </h2>",
   "body": "<p>刀具制造商或磨削企业的专业水平体现在切削刃的钝化处理以及表面光洁度的均匀性上。»﻿﻿﻿﻿mµFocus«﻿﻿﻿﻿ 使这种高超的专业水平得以量化。</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ch/%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A/%E8%81%94%E7%B3%BB%E6%88%91%E4%BB%AC\">立即咨询</a> <a href=\"https://myzoller.com/de/de/expert/booking/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">1:1 专家对话</a></p>",
   "images": [],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "text",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
